                        ],
                        "form": "вяза́нках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c4d6e2db-cba3-3e2e-a7ac-44f0b1b18536",
                        "entry_id": "89f6dbf4-4178-3ecc-86f7-5272ac46329d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "связка дров, сушняка, соломы"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "с род. п."
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0dfb56de-896c-4756-8021-c18239a58aa1",
                                "sense_id": "c4d6e2db-cba3-3e2e-a7ac-44f0b1b18536",
                                "text": "Какая-нибудь вязанка хворосту горит у рыбаков у самой воды, и свет далеко-далеко по воде льётся."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6f73f1c0-7ee6-47d0-8451-6d6fa35be90d",
                        "source_entry_id": "89f6dbf4-4178-3ecc-86f7-5272ac46329d",
                        "source_sense_id": "c4d6e2db-cba3-3e2e-a7ac-44f0b1b18536",
                        "target_lang_word": "faggot",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "faggot",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88c4ccbe-cdd6-31c5-bae9-8d3f78e68a9d",
                                        "entry_id": "d2a56e09-7c1d-3678-a34f-821b54db08f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bundle of sticks or brushwood intended to be used for fuel tied together for carrying. (Some sources specify that a faggot is tied with two bands or withes, whereas a bavin is tied with just one.)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "UK",
                                            "collective"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b2a97b1-5e8e-456c-a2bc-9fbf4b66d766",
                                                "sense_id": "88c4ccbe-cdd6-31c5-bae9-8d3f78e68a9d",
                                                "text": "In the depth of, winter, however, a faggot of real French Sticks — although of little intrinsic value — may possibly enliven for a few moments an English Fireside."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6801828b-9646-459f-81b5-247cf3dedfb6",
                                                "sense_id": "88c4ccbe-cdd6-31c5-bae9-8d3f78e68a9d",
                                                "text": "Besides the logs and roots that simmered with turves and dung on the cottage fire, rapid heat for bread-making came from faggots - bundles of dry twigs about 4 ft long - which were fed into the oven, burned and then removed as ash before the dough went in."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "259df628-3070-3b58-9bec-b3430a067c03",
                                        "entry_id": "d2a56e09-7c1d-3678-a34f-821b54db08f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Burdensome baggage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d924e765-7757-333c-b988-94586b2574b1",
                                        "entry_id": "d2a56e09-7c1d-3678-a34f-821b54db08f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bundle of pieces of iron or steel cut off into suitable lengths for welding."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06565e87-7b8f-3db6-8e63-423d8d520d8e",
                                        "entry_id": "d2a56e09-7c1d-3678-a34f-821b54db08f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A burning or smouldering piece of firewood."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e81a1120-8bc1-4c67-ac43-d10a8d5c0d87",
                                                "sense_id": "06565e87-7b8f-3db6-8e63-423d8d520d8e",
                                                "text": "He clambered back on his feet and grinned at them. The waning faggot cast red light over his fangs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bb8cfac-ddbe-48ad-be38-45d1e2988fde",
                                                "sense_id": "06565e87-7b8f-3db6-8e63-423d8d520d8e",
                                                "text": "To the east, the night grew a faggot of luminous gray, then seashell opalescence that dimmed the stars."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72a89900-58e7-3234-9491-107f151f0d8b",
                                        "entry_id": "d2a56e09-7c1d-3678-a34f-821b54db08f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A meatball made with offcuts and offal, especially pork. (See Wikipedia.)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "UK"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "572cb29f-1d2e-4bc9-8557-c85afa935626",
                                                "sense_id": "72a89900-58e7-3234-9491-107f151f0d8b",
                                                "text": "Today would be faggots in gravy and chocolate pudding with a white sauce. I didn't like faggots but picked at them and rolled the peas around my plate."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2203c55b-6258-3d41-a85f-a28474f942d3",
                                        "entry_id": "d2a56e09-7c1d-3678-a34f-821b54db08f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A gay man, especially an effeminate one."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "offensive",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f3657b3-4650-432d-9273-4fb013036c28",
                                                "sense_id": "2203c55b-6258-3d41-a85f-a28474f942d3",
                                                "text": "Drag, Example: “All the fagots (sissies) will be dressed in drag at the ball tonight."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08a80165-f941-49b0-a7a8-a200642eef6c",
                                                "sense_id": "2203c55b-6258-3d41-a85f-a28474f942d3",
                                                "text": "See the little faggot with the earring and the makeup? / Yeah buddy, that's his own hair / That little faggot got his own jet airplane / That little faggot, he's a millionaire"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4df8eb9-5b5e-4d6b-a747-1782cec8335d",
                                                "sense_id": "2203c55b-6258-3d41-a85f-a28474f942d3",
                                                "text": "We're a hot looking crew that's your average faggot's wet dream, so we pull some pretty max tricks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0f9afe2-fc8b-4376-a012-8b80e45683d7",
                                                "sense_id": "2203c55b-6258-3d41-a85f-a28474f942d3",
                                                "text": "Fleissner's explanation presumably implies that Dickens meant Fag as an allusion to the derogatory English words fag 'homosexual', and faggot 'homosexual'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6be462bc-7adc-40ea-9c6c-7ac7b60315ae",
                                                "sense_id": "2203c55b-6258-3d41-a85f-a28474f942d3",
                                                "text": "2012, Margaret Cho, quoted (mimicking Karl Lagerfeld) in On Making Sense: Queer Race Narratives of Intelligibility\nOf course I'm a faggot, darling. I'm a flaming faggot, darling. I am fanning the flames of my faggotry."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3437c7bc-00ad-3eb3-9c56-5e08b3b3a86e",
                                        "entry_id": "d2a56e09-7c1d-3678-a34f-821b54db08f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A non-heterosexual man."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "47e12988-e283-37f3-8e73-a56af17c683a",
                                        "entry_id": "d2a56e09-7c1d-3678-a34f-821b54db08f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A man considered weak, effeminate, timid, pathetic, emotional, non-heteronormative in some way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canada",
                                            "US",
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab573145-d9ad-3526-a4b1-81591312c637",
                                        "entry_id": "d2a56e09-7c1d-3678-a34f-821b54db08f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An annoying or inconsiderate person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canada",
                                            "US",
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "670cbe0c-6c87-3c32-99a1-18aa87b50276",
                                        "entry_id": "d2a56e09-7c1d-3678-a34f-821b54db08f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A shrewish woman."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "UK",
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "dated",
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "offensive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67f82e9e-8150-47ff-978b-9511b16eb8a9",
                                                "sense_id": "670cbe0c-6c87-3c32-99a1-18aa87b50276",
                                                "text": "I appoynt thée no more continencie, than to eate while thy bellie is full, nor conﬅancie, but to brawle rather than burne: a filbert is better than a faggot, except it be an Athenian ſhe handfull: you know that Coſmoſophos, euer ſince your laﬅ mariage, how doth the father of your ſonne in law?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70a0fd17-e020-49f6-8c45-47c272200d94",
                                                "sense_id": "670cbe0c-6c87-3c32-99a1-18aa87b50276",
                                                "text": "she wants me to go to bed to her, and I won't, ... for she is as crooked as a ram's horn ... and as ugly as sin besides ; rot her, the dirty little faggot, she torments me."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "144cfb25-59e5-4f96-9c6d-d8c52cfe5991",
                                                "sense_id": "670cbe0c-6c87-3c32-99a1-18aa87b50276",
                                                "text": "The woman, in accordance with the custom of the country, raised the Irish cry, in a loud melancholy wail ...\nDarby, who prided himself on maintaining silence, could not preserve the consistency of his character upon this occasion ... \"Your sowl to the divil, you faggot!\" he exclaimed, \"what do you mane? The divil whip the tongue out o' you! ...\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "018c756f-d6f3-4776-945e-717f56e2b684",
                                                "sense_id": "670cbe0c-6c87-3c32-99a1-18aa87b50276",
                                                "text": "he used to be pretending to be laid up with a sick voice doing his highness to make himself interesting for that old faggot Mrs Riordan that he thought he had a great leg of and she never left us a farthing all for masses for herself and her soul greatest miser ever was actually afraid to lay out 4d for her methylated spirit […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6001e007-f4e5-448a-82a6-3e3204583088",
                                                "sense_id": "670cbe0c-6c87-3c32-99a1-18aa87b50276",
                                                "text": "To me she is fractious, tiresome, and a faggot. Yet the subtle desirableness is in her, for me. As it is in the brown hen, or even a sow."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "609a5188-d47d-486f-9668-22556f9c24ff",
                                                "sense_id": "670cbe0c-6c87-3c32-99a1-18aa87b50276",
                                                "text": "MOTHER: To see who?\nDA: You faggot, you; don't let on you don't know."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eba0794b-efb2-3c8f-a77a-ff7ab9639130",
                                        "entry_id": "d2a56e09-7c1d-3678-a34f-821b54db08f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A soldier numbered on the muster roll, but not really existing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "possibly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd23dad8-d1eb-335f-a9af-7b492915b194",
                                        "entry_id": "d2a56e09-7c1d-3678-a34f-821b54db08f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A faggot voter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "UK",
                                            "historical",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "possibly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1a47666-378c-46bb-98ba-e673ce940ecb",
                                                "sense_id": "bd23dad8-d1eb-335f-a9af-7b492915b194",
                                                "text": "The Glasgow Herald thought that his attack on the faggots was too serious […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
